## Model card

- **Name:** MiniMax M3.1 Flash Preview
- **Short description:** MiniMax's preview-tier multimodal coding model launched quietly 2026-09-27 inside MiniMax Code and the Token Plan — positioned as a fast everyday coding model for quick bug fixes through full features; sits beside (does not replace) MiniMax-M3 / M2.7 in the model list.
- **Provider / access:** MiniMax Code CLI/IDE product and the MiniMax Token Plan **only** (blue-banner restriction in official docs); no public pay-as-you-go API model ID yet. Promo: double check-in credits 2026-09-28 → 2026-10-07 (UTC+8) + Token Plan quota resets at launch (PromptBluePrints, 2026-09-27).
- **Release / knowledge:** 2026-09-27 (@MiniMaxAgent launch post; SaaSCity guide updated 2026-09-28). Knowledge cutoff: not published.
- **IDs:** `MiniMax-M3.1-Flash-Preview` (official model ID); no public API id; no Zen Free ID.
- **Context window:** 1,000,000 tokens (official docs via SaaSCity); max output not published.
- **Modalities:** text, image, video in; text out (official docs); five effort levels `low / medium / high / xhigh / max` (default **max**); thinking **cannot be disabled**.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-09-28):** no public per-token price — Token Plan / MiniMax Code only; free promo credits at launch window.
- **Architecture:** not disclosed — no model card, no parameter count, no open weights published (SaaSCity: leaks on params are unverified).

